      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The opossum is reduced below 15 HP</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The opossum collapses. It is Off-Guard and can use actions that require only its mind, but any other action ends the ruse.</p>\n<p>A successful DC 18 Perception  check to Seek or DC 18 Medicine  check to Recall Knowledge is required to determine that the animal is not, in fact, dead.</p>",
